{
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "description": "Stage A + dependency graph + per-service drill-down. Click any node in the Node Graph to open the service-detail dashboard pre-filtered to that service.",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [
    {
      "asDropdown": false,
      "icon": "dashboard",
      "tags": [],
      "title": "Service detail (per-service drill-down)",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/d/otel-lab-service-detail/otel-lab-service-detail"
    },
    {
      "asDropdown": false,
      "icon": "dashboard",
      "tags": [],
      "title": "JMX dashboards",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/d/otel-lab-jmx/otel-lab-jmx-kafka-hbase-hdfs"
    }
  ],
  "liveNow": true,
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 100,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Drill into selected service \u2193",
      "description": "The Node Graph below is rendered from Tempo's serviceMap query, which in Grafana 11 overrides custom node click links with Tempo's built-in 'Open in Explore' actions. Use the Service dropdown above + this panel as a guaranteed drill-in path. Click anywhere on this panel to open the per-service detail dashboard.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 3,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "blue"
          },
          "unit": "reqps",
          "displayName": "${service}  \u2192  click to open detail",
          "links": [
            {
              "title": "Open service-detail dashboard for ${service}",
              "url": "/d/otel-lab-service-detail/otel-lab-service-detail?var-service=${service}&${__url_time_range}",
              "targetBlank": false
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(traces_spanmetrics_calls_total{service=\"$service\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 101,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to drill in",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 3,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Pick a service** from the dropdown above, then click the blue panel \u2190.\n\n- **Per-service detail**: [/d/otel-lab-service-detail?var-service=${service}](/d/otel-lab-service-detail/otel-lab-service-detail?var-service=${service})\n- **Logs for ${service}**: [open in Loki Explore](/explore?left=%7B%22datasource%22:%22loki%22,%22queries%22:%5B%7B%22expr%22:%22%7Bservice%3D%5C%22${service}%5C%22%7D%22%7D%5D%7D)\n- **JMX dashboards**: [/d/otel-lab-jmx](/d/otel-lab-jmx/otel-lab-jmx-kafka-hbase-hdfs)\n\n*Tempo's serviceMap menu (right side of the Node Graph) gives you Tempo-native drill-ins: Request rate, Histogram, Failed rate, View traces.*"
      }
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "tempo"
      },
      "description": "Dependency graph derived from observed traffic. Tempo's serviceMap query returns the right node/edge schema for the Node Graph panel. Click any node to drill into the per-service detail dashboard.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 14,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3
      },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "nodes": {
          "mainStatUnit": "short"
        },
        "edges": {
          "mainStatUnit": "short"
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "links": [
            {
              "title": "Open service detail for ${__data.fields.title}",
              "url": "/d/otel-lab-service-detail/otel-lab-service-detail?var-service=${__data.fields.title}&${__url_time_range}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          },
          "queryType": "serviceMap",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Service Graph (click a node to drill in)",
      "type": "nodeGraph"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "decimals": 2,
          "links": [
            {
              "title": "Open service detail for ${__field.labels.service}",
              "url": "/d/otel-lab-service-detail/otel-lab-service-detail?var-service=${__field.labels.service}&${__url_time_range}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 17
      },
      "id": 2,
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (service) (rate(traces_spanmetrics_calls_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "RED \u2014 Rate by service",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "decimals": 2,
          "links": [
            {
              "title": "Open service detail for ${__field.labels.service}",
              "url": "/d/otel-lab-service-detail/otel-lab-service-detail?var-service=${__field.labels.service}&${__url_time_range}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 17
      },
      "id": 3,
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (service) (rate(traces_spanmetrics_calls_total{status_code=\"STATUS_CODE_ERROR\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "RED \u2014 Errors by service",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "links": [
            {
              "title": "Open service detail for ${__field.labels.service}",
              "url": "/d/otel-lab-service-detail/otel-lab-service-detail?var-service=${__field.labels.service}&${__url_time_range}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 17
      },
      "id": 4,
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le, service) (rate(traces_spanmetrics_latency_bucket[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}} p99",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "RED \u2014 p99 latency by service",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 25
      },
      "id": 5,
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (service_name) (jvm_memory_used_bytes{type=\"heap\"} or process_runtime_jvm_memory_usage_bytes{type=\"heap\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{service_name}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "JVM heap used by service",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 25
      },
      "id": 6,
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (service_name) (rate(jvm_gc_duration_seconds_sum[$__rate_interval]) or rate(process_runtime_jvm_gc_duration_seconds_sum[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service_name}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "JVM GC pause time by service",
      "type": "timeseries"
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "10s",
  "schemaVersion": 38,
  "tags": [
    "otel",
    "stage-a",
    "service-map",
    "RED"
  ],
